---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Pathfinder 2e · UndrwrldCub">
<header style="position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;background:rgba(14,12,18,.92);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);border-bottom:1px solid #2D2838">
  <div style="max-width:1160px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px;height:64px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px">
    <a href="/" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;color:#F6F1FA;font-family:'Cinzel',Georgia,serif;font-weight:700;font-size:19px;white-space:nowrap">
      <img src="/brand/octopus-192.png" alt="" style="width:40px;height:40px;object-fit:contain"><span>UndrwrldCub</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/#realms" style="margin-left:auto;font-family:'Barlow Semi Condensed',sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;color:#A69DB4;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px"class="nav-link">← All realms</a>
  </div>
</header>

<section style="border-bottom:1px solid #2D2838;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(224,106,88,.10),#0E0C12 90%)">
  <div style="max-width:1160px;margin:0 auto;padding:36px 20px 32px;display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:flex-start;flex-wrap:wrap">
    <div style="width:58px;height:58px;border-radius:14px;flex:0 0 auto;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Cinzel',Georgia,serif;font-weight:700;font-size:26px;color:#E06A58;background:rgba(224,106,88,.16);border:1px solid rgba(224,106,88,.4)">P</div>
    <div style="flex:1 1 320px;min-width:0">
      <div style="font-family:'Barlow Semi Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600;color:#E06A58">The table</div>
      <h1 style="font-family:'Cinzel',Georgia,serif;font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(30px,4.4vw,46px);line-height:1.2;margin:4px 0 8px;color:#F6F1FA">Pathfinder Second Edition</h1>
      <p style="font-size:18px;color:#A69DB4;max-width:72ch;margin:0;text-wrap:pretty">We sit behind the screen. Six players, one long‑running campaign, and the Remaster rules as the law of the land.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<main style="max-width:1160px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px">
  <section style="margin-top:44px">
    <h2 style="font-family:'Cinzel',Georgia,serif;font-size:clamp(22px,2.4vw,28px);font-weight:700;margin:0;color:#F6F1FA">The Cat City Campaign</h2>
    <div style="width:44px;height:2px;margin:8px 0 18px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#E06A58,transparent)"></div>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:16px">
      <div style="background:#18151F;border:1px solid #2D2838;border-radius:12px;padding:20px">
        <h3 style="margin:0 0 6px;font-size:20px;color:#F6F1FA">A converted world</h3>
        <p style="margin:0;color:#A69DB4;font-size:15px">Cat City began as a 5e game. In 2026 the whole table moved to Pathfinder 2e Remaster, and the campaign came with it: same city, same cast, new rules underneath.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#18151F;border:1px solid #2D2838;border-radius:12px;padding:20px">
        <h3 style="margin:0 0 6px;font-size:20px;color:#F6F1FA">Six at the table</h3>
        <p style="margin:0;color:#A69DB4;font-size:15px">A regular roster of six players. Sessions run Monday evenings, 6:00 to 9:00 PM, at the lair, with the occasional Beginner Box one‑shot when the full party can't make it.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#18151F;border:1px solid #2D2838;border-radius:12px;padding:20px">
        <h3 style="margin:0 0 6px;font-size:20px;color:#F6F1FA">A living record</h3>
        <p style="margin:0;color:#A69DB4;font-size:15px">Every session gets a debrief: NPCs met, threads pulled, secrets learned. Recurring villains, patrons, and shopkeepers are catalogued so they can return without being rebuilt.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="margin-top:52px">
    <h2 style="font-family:'Cinzel',Georgia,serif;font-size:clamp(22px,2.4vw,28px);font-weight:700;margin:0;color:#F6F1FA">How we run the game</h2>
    <div style="width:44px;height:2px;margin:8px 0 18px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#E06A58,transparent)"></div>
    <div style="background:#18151F;border:1px solid #2D2838;border-radius:12px;padding:6px 18px">
      <dl style="margin:0">
        <div style="padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #2D2838;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(120px,180px) 1fr;gap:12px">
          <dt style="font-family:'Barlow Semi Condensed',sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#756D84;padding-top:3px">Rules</dt>
          <dd style="margin:0">Pathfinder 2e Remaster (Player Core, GM Core, Monster Core). Legacy terms get translated at the table: flat‑footed is off‑guard, and so on.</dd>
        </div>
        <div style="padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #2D2838;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(120px,180px) 1fr;gap:12px">
          <dt style="font-family:'Barlow Semi Condensed',sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#756D84;padding-top:3px">Characters</dt>
          <dd style="margin:0">Hero Lab Online holds every PC and NPC. Party state is pulled from it before each session so prep works from what is actually on the sheets.</dd>
        </div>
        <div style="padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #2D2838;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(120px,180px) 1fr;gap:12px">
          <dt style="font-family:'Barlow Semi Condensed',sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#756D84;padding-top:3px">Session prep</dt>
          <dd style="margin:0">One tool per night: a token map, initiative and HP trackers, stat block cards, loot table, and a pre‑session checklist, built from the live campaign roster.</dd>
        </div>
        <div style="padding:12px 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(120px,180px) 1fr;gap:12px">
          <dt style="font-family:'Barlow Semi Condensed',sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#756D84;padding-top:3px">Rules lookups</dt>
          <dd style="margin:0">A chunked, searchable library of the PF2e books with page citations, so a mid‑combat “how does this work” gets a real answer.</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="margin-top:52px;background:#18151F;border:1px solid #2D2838;border-left:3px solid #E06A58;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 18px">
    <strong style="color:#F6F1FA">Coming to this page:</strong> <span style="color:#A69DB4">session recaps, the recurring cast, and house rules. For now, the notes live behind the screen.</span>
  </section>
</main>

<footer style="margin-top:72px;border-top:1px solid #2D2838;background:#13111A">
  <div style="max-width:1160px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px 20px 36px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:18px 40px;align-items:center;font-size:14px;color:#A69DB4">
    <img src="/brand/octopus-192.png" alt="" style="width:56px;height:56px;object-fit:contain">
    <div style="flex:1 1 320px">© 2026 UndrwrldCub. Pathfinder is a trademark of Paizo Inc. This page is unofficial fan content.</div>
    <a href="/" style="font-family:'Barlow Semi Condensed',sans-serif;font-weight:600">undrwrldcub.com</a>
  </div>
</footer>
</Base>
